亚洲的古吉-罕贝拉区域，Buku也是处理站所在小区域的地名，Buku处理站也是埃塞几个海拔较高的处理站之一（海拔约2350米），由于地形地势的特别，这里一个显著的特色是小农们都是用马或者驴子来驮着咖啡果运送。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkD9fuZACPgTAJ2se9XpIib58bjn55bfiaPlPyLgBdpgf5cTtnq6VJ4f4Iw4cLdU99Tia7Qb8v6k7icA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n           图片来自 Nordic Approach\n          </span>\n<span style='color: rgb(178, 178, 178);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Sayisa是处理站周边生活的小部族Sayisa的名字，有近430户小农种植咖啡，每到产季时，小农们先将咖啡鲜果提交给\n          <span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-family: \"Avenir Next\", sans-serif;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n           “小组长”Mr Esayas Beriso，由Esayas统筹管理再交给Buku处理站。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TkD9fuZACPgTAJ2se9XpIibzldDcSGNK9428GkXJwE54YSqCPH8oIcicUJ8J5pawswSu6eaibgHaeeA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n          图片来自 Nordic Approach\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-family: \"Avenir Next\", sans-serif;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          Buku处理站每年会处理来自附近区域的很多咖啡，其中我们耳熟能详的\n         </span>\n<span style='color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-family: \"Avenir Next\", sans-serif;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          BUKU ABEL, SIKE BOKOSA, TRITRA GOYO 和HARO SORSA\n         </span>\n<span style='color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-family: \"Avenir Next\", sans-serif;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='color: rgb(142, 157, 174);font-family: \"Open Sans\", sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n</span>\n          也有这里加工处理过的批次。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TkD9fuZACPgTAJ2se9XpIibL9nPwZtOU1h8D9Nkia91HgwuibibHX5gQvuF9CicCictqRqiaktRrbGW9BsA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n          图片来自Allay Coffee\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='color: rgb(39, 39, 39);font-family: \"Avenir Next\", sans-serif;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          Buku处理站处理的咖啡，鲜果干燥结束后会送到Hambella区域的首府Dimtu镇的脱壳厂去脱壳和进一步的筛选，然后再送到首都Addis的品控中心和仓库做给每一个客户批次的最后分选和包装发运。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          它也是一只典型的Guji日晒，热带水果复合着Guji特有的柠檬红茶感的风味调性，口感非常的圆润，\n          <em>\n           很奇怪，我每次喝到这样的咖啡，总有个词“肉肉的”挥之不去，可能是它的口感带来的一种厚实饱满让我觉得好像是咬了一口很肥美的菠萝或者芒果什么的。（重复使用）\n          </em>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<em>\n<br/>\n</em>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          希望你们也喜欢它！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          <br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 431px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n</div>",
